@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ---------- 1. LOGIN ALS PLAYER ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/security/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "player1",
  "password": "player123"
}

### Wie is er ingelogd?
POST {{baseUrl}}/security/login/check

### Nieuw access token vragen met het refresh token -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/security/refresh

### ---------- 2. MATCHES ----------
### 2x versturen: in de terminal van de server zie je "Cache MISS" en daarna "Cache HIT"
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches?status=finished

### upcoming: [0] = al begonnen, [1] = player1 heeft al voorspeld, [2] = vrij
# @name upcoming
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches?status=upcoming

### fout statusfilter -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches?status=bestaatniet


### ---------- 3. TEAMS ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams

### ---------- 4. MIJN VOORSPELLINGEN ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/predictions

### ---------- 5. KLASSEMENT ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/ranking

### ---------- 6a. VOORSPELLING PLAATSEN ----------
### OK -> 201 (tweede keer -> 400: al voorspeld)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{upcoming.response.body.$[2]._id}}/predictions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": 2,
  "awayScore": 1
}

### match al begonnen -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{upcoming.response.body.$[0]._id}}/predictions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": 2,
  "awayScore": 1
}

### al een voorspelling -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{upcoming.response.body.$[1]._id}}/predictions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": 0,
  "awayScore": 0
}

### negatieve score -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{upcoming.response.body.$[3]._id}}/predictions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": -1,
  "awayScore": 0
}

### score is tekst -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{upcoming.response.body.$[3]._id}}/predictions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": "twee",
  "awayScore": 0
}

### match bestaat niet -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/predictions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": 1,
  "awayScore": 0
}

### player mag geen uitslag invoeren -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{upcoming.response.body.$[0]._id}}/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": 1,
  "awayScore": 0
}

### ---------- LOGIN ALS ADMIN ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/security/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### admin mag niet aan /player -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/ranking

### ---------- 6b. UITSLAG INVOEREN ----------
### OK -> 202 Accepted (tweede keer -> 400: al een uitslag)
### De consumer berekent daarna de punten (zie de terminal van de consumer).
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{upcoming.response.body.$[0]._id}}/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": 1,
  "awayScore": 0
}

### score ontbreekt -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{upcoming.response.body.$[1]._id}}/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": 1
}

### match bestaat niet -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeScore": 1,
  "awayScore": 0
}

### ---------- KLASSEMENT NA DE CONSUMER ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/security/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "player1",
  "password": "player123"
}

### player1 voorspelde 1-0 -> 3 punten erbij: nu 7 punten, plaats 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/ranking

### ---------- UITLOGGEN ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/security/logout

### na uitloggen -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams

### na uitloggen kan je ook niet meer vernieuwen -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/security/refresh